        1010
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Commission on Youth Empowerment Services (the \"Commission\") is hereby established. The Commission shall be comprised of members to be appointed by the Mayor, including, but not limited to, members representing the business, labor, financial and professional service communities, as well as the not-for-profit community. The Commission shall also include, ex officio, the Deputy Mayor for Education and Human Services, the Commissioner of the Department of Employment and such other public officials as may be appointed by the Mayor upon the recommendation of a majority of the Commission. The Chancellor of the City School District of the City of New York shall be invited to participate as a member. The Mayor shall designate a chairperson from among the members. Members shall serve without compensation and at the pleasure of the Mayor.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
