    {
      "bbox": [
        193,
        1207,
        1508,
        1630
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "a. Advise and assist the Mayor in a focused and coordinated effort to mobilize both the public and private sector, including the for-profit and not-for-profit communities, to identify existing employment opportunities, to develop additional employment opportunities that are appropriate for young people in the City, including summer jobs, part-time and full-time jobs and paid internships, and to develop methods to match the talents and interests of young people with available employment positions.",
